  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance Facility &#xBF;Digital and Science, Technology and Innovation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &#xBF;TAF&amp;nbsp;D4D&amp;nbsp;STI&#xBF;&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;support&amp;nbsp;EU&amp;nbsp;services&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;design&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;implementation&amp;nbsp;of Directorate-General&amp;nbsp;for International Partnerships &#xBF; (DG INTPA) projects/initiatives/programmes in the field of Digital for Development, and Science, Technology and Innovation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;geographic&amp;nbsp;scope&amp;nbsp;is:&amp;nbsp;African,&amp;nbsp;Caribbean&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Pacific&amp;nbsp;(ACP)&amp;nbsp;group&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;states&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Overseas&amp;nbsp;Countries&amp;nbsp;and Territories&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(OCT). Partner countries will&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;reflect DG INTPA(D4D&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Hub2)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp; Directorate-General&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;for Communications Networks, Content and Technology (DG CNECT)priority countries but will be flexible to respond to demands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The services will be provided in particular to the European Commission, both to headquarters in Brussels and to the EU&amp;nbsp;Delegations&amp;nbsp;(EUDs),&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;partner&amp;nbsp;countries&#xBF;&amp;nbsp;governments&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;limited&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;extent&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;key Digital4Development&amp;nbsp;(D4D)&amp;nbsp;stakeholders.The Technical&amp;nbsp;Assistance&amp;nbsp;Facility&amp;nbsp;(TAF)will&amp;nbsp;allow&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;mobilisation&amp;nbsp;in coordination with EU Member States, the European External Action Service (EEAS), as well as other DGssuch as DG CNECT, Directorate-GeneralJoint Research Center (DG JRC).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
